The Main> prompt is CNet's "gateway" to all of the system's various subsystems. From here, you can get to:

        B       The Message base
        U       The Upload and Download base
        G       The General text files
        J       The Conference Rooms
        L       The BBSList program
        N       The News bulletins
        P       The Program files
        V       The Voting Booth
        UL      The User List system

From any of these areas, the QUIT command is useful to bring you back to Main>.

Other topics of interest:

BASE            GFILES          JOIN            PFILES          NEWS
UPLOAD          DOWNLOAD        VOTE
